              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakundwa, hamwe nashiruka umwete wo kubandikira ivy’ agakiza dusangiye, nari numvise ikingōbēra kubandikira ivyo kubahanūra kurwanira cane ukwizera abera bahawe rimwe gusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
