        {
          "text": "Ndagomba kubibutsa, naho vyose musanzwe mubizi, yuk’ Umwami Imana, imaze gukirisha bga bgoko kubakūra mu gihugu ca Egiputa, hanyuma yahoneje abatizeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.5",
