        {
          "text": "N’abamarayika batāgumye mu bukuru bgabo, ariko bātaye ahantu habo, ibarindira kuzocirwakw iteka ryo ku musi uhambaye, bari mu minyororo idashira no mu mwiza. ",
          "type": "text",
